    hub_kazgenre_desc: "Poem, tale, riddle",
    kazgenre_explain: "Barsik is learning to tell apart different genres of Kazakh texts! A poem, a fairy tale, and a riddle each have their own features. Read the description and choose what this genre is called in Kazakh. Ready?",
