    hub_alphabetorder_desc: "Like in a dictionary",
    alphabetorder_explain: "Barsik is learning to use a dictionary! In a dictionary, words are arranged alphabetically — the letters go in order: А, Б, В, Г... Look at the two letters and choose which one comes first in the alphabet. Ready?",
