    hub_plantparts_desc: "Root, stem, leaf, flower...",
    hub_lecture_plantparts_title: "Lesson: Plant Parts",
    hub_lecture_plantparts_desc: "Root, stem, leaf, flower in depth",
    lecture_plantparts_title: "Lesson: Plant Parts",
    lecture_plantparts_sub: "Learn why a plant needs each part",
    plantparts_s1_title: "Plant Parts",
    plantparts_s1_text: "Barsik is studying plants! Every plant has different parts, and each one has its own job. Ready to study plants?",
    plantparts_s2_title: "Root",
    plantparts_s2_text: "The root is underground. It holds the plant firmly in place and drinks water from the soil for it.",
    plantparts_s3_title: "Stem",
    plantparts_s3_text: "The stem is like the trunk or branch of a plant. It holds the plant upright and carries water from the root to the leaves.",
    plantparts_s4_title: "Leaf",
    plantparts_s4_text: "Leaves catch sunlight — this helps the plant grow. They're like tiny sunlight traps.",
    plantparts_s5_title: "Flower",
    plantparts_s5_text: "The flower is the brightest part of the plant. Over time it turns into a fruit, and seeds hide inside the fruit.",
    plantparts_s6_title: "You've Studied Plant Parts!",
    plantparts_s6_text: "Barsik is proud of you — now you know the root, stem, leaf, and flower! Ready to test yourself in the game?",
    plantparts_game_title: "Parts of a Plant!",
    plantparts_game_sub: "What is this part of a plant called? Find the picture",
    plantparts_explain: "Barsik is studying plants! Every plant has different parts: the root holds it in the ground and drinks water, the stem supports the plant, the leaves catch sunlight, and the flower turns into a fruit with seeds inside. Look at the part's name and find the matching picture. Ready to study plants?",
