    spacetime_explain: "Barsik is studying space and time! To learn about space, scientists use rockets — to fly there, and telescopes — to look at distant stars. And to measure time, people use clocks, calendars, and hourglasses. Look at the name and find the matching picture. Ready to study instruments?",
