    hub_light_title: "Light: Natural or Artificial?",
    hub_light_desc: "The sun shines by itself, but a lamp?",
    light_game_title: "Light: Natural or Artificial?",
    light_game_sub: "Is this light source natural, or did people make it?",
    light_explain: "Barsik is studying light! The sun, the moon, and lightning shine on their own — these are natural light sources. But a lightbulb, a candle, and a flashlight were invented and made by people — these are artificial light sources. Look at the picture and think: is this light natural, or artificial? Ready to sort out light?",
