  "hub_est2resources_title": "Natürliche Ressourcen",
  "hub_est2resources_desc": "Wasser, Luft, Boden, Kohle, Wald",
  "est2earthsun_explain": "Barsik will tell you about the Earth, the Sun and the Moon! The Sun is a star and gives the Earth light and warmth. The Earth is our planet. The Moon is the natural satellite of the Earth: it moves around it. Find the right picture, sort the space bodies and answer \"true\" or \"false\". Ready?",
