  "est2planets_explain": "Barsik will tell you about the planets! Eight planets move around the Sun: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus and Neptune. They differ in size and in distance from the Sun. Find the right picture, sort the planets and answer \"true\" or \"false\". Ready?",
