  "est2magnetuse_explain": "Barsik will tell you about magnets! A magnet attracts objects made of iron. Magnets are used at home and in industry: on a fridge door, in bag fasteners, in a compass, in toys and in cranes that lift metal. Find the right picture, sort the objects and answer \"true\" or \"false\". Ready?",
